      "content": "IMPORTANT SUPREME COURT CASES"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Collective responsibility under Article 75(3) is specifically to the House of the People (Lok Sabha), not Parliament as a whole.",
        "By the 91st Amendment Act of 2003, the total number of ministers including the PM cannot exceed 15% of the total strength of the Lok Sabha.",
        "The nature of advice tendered by Ministers to the President cannot be inquired into in any court (Article 74(2))."
      ],
      "id": "m253wev"
